	"Leave empty and paste a private key below if the account enforces MFA, which blocks password sign-in for unattended services.": "如果账户强制使用 MFA，无人值守服务无法使用密码登录，请留空并在下方粘贴私钥。",
	"Private Key (PEM)": "私钥（PEM）",
	"Key-pair authentication. Paste the full PEM for a key registered on the Snowflake user. Used instead of a password.": "密钥对认证：粘贴已注册到 Snowflake 用户的完整 PEM 私钥，用于替代密码。",
	"Private Key Passphrase": "私钥口令",
	"Only needed if the private key above is encrypted.": "仅在上述私钥已加密时需要填写。",
	"Protocol": "协议",
	"Generate Token Client ID": "生成令牌的客户端 ID",
	"The SSA client ID for a service account, or your account name when using a pasted token.": "服务账户的 SSA 客户端 ID；使用粘贴的令牌时填写您的账户名。",
	"Generate Token Client Secret": "生成令牌的客户端密钥",
	"The SSA client secret when a token URL is set below, otherwise a JWT copied from the data platform profile page.": "如果下方配置了令牌 URL，请填写 SSA 客户端密钥；否则填写从数据平台个人资料页复制的 JWT。",
	"Generate Token URL": "生成令牌的 URL",
	"Enables service-account auth. Tokens expire hourly, so this lets the connector mint fresh ones instead of failing after an hour.": "启用服务账户认证。令牌每小时过期，连接器将自动获取新令牌以保持连接。",
	"Truststore (JKS)": "信任库（JKS）",
	"Upload the CA truststore. Needed when the server does not already trust the internal CA.": "上传 CA 信任库。服务器尚未信任内部 CA 时需要此文件。",
	"Truststore Password": "信任库密码",
	"On an unauthenticated cluster this is only the identity Trino records against the query.": "在无需认证的集群上，此值仅用作 Trino 记录查询时的用户身份。",
	"Leave empty for an unauthenticated cluster. A password switches the connection to HTTPS, which Trino requires before it will accept one.": "无需认证的集群请留空。填写密码会将连接切换为 HTTPS，这是 Trino 接受密码的前提。",
	"Ingest only this schema. Leave empty to pick schemas from a list instead.": "仅采集此 Schema。留空则从列表选择。",
	"A pasted ClickHouse Cloud endpoint may include https://; the scheme is kept as the transport.": "粘贴的 ClickHouse Cloud 端点可包含 https://，系统会保留该传输协议。",
	"The HTTP interface: 8123 by default, 8443 on ClickHouse Cloud.": "HTTP 接口：默认 8123，ClickHouse Cloud 使用 8443。",
	"Leave empty to connect as the server default user.": "留空则使用服务器默认用户连接。",
	"ClickHouse has no schema below the database, so one connection covers one database. Add a second connection for a second database.": "ClickHouse 数据库下没有 Schema，因此一个连接对应一个数据库。其他数据库需要另建连接。",
	"Leave empty to infer from the port: https on 443 and 8443, http otherwise. Set https explicitly for a TLS listener on any other port — unlike Trino, a password alone does not imply TLS here.": "留空则按端口推断：443 和 8443 使用 HTTPS，其他端口使用 HTTP。其他端口上的 TLS 服务需显式填写 https。此处填写密码不会自动启用 TLS。",
	"Table Allowlist (Regex)": "表允许列表（正则表达式）",
	"Leave Empty to Ingest Every Table": "留空以采集全部表",
	"Ingest only tables whose name matches. Unanchored and case-sensitive, so \"fact_\" matches \"fact_sales\"; anchor with ^ and $ for an exact name.": "仅采集名称匹配的表。匹配区分大小写，默认不限定首尾，因此“fact_”可匹配“fact_sales”。使用 ^ 和 $ 可匹配完整名称。",
	"Table Denylist (Regex)": "表排除列表（正则表达式）",
	"Leave Empty to Exclude Nothing": "留空则不排除任何表",
	"Skip tables whose name matches, even if the allowlist also matches them. Use this for relations the warehouse lists but cannot actually read, such as a broken Distributed table or a Kafka queue.": "跳过名称匹配的表，即使允许列表也匹配。适用于仓库中存在但无法读取的关系，例如异常的 Distributed 表或 Kafka 队列。",
